{
  "key": "proposal",
  "typeName": "Client Proposal Letter",
  "source": "Derived 20 October 2026 from the approved client proposal pack (5 Packs to check/06 client proposal, a shell cut from the firm's August 2026 proposal, the owner's chosen base) and the firm's five other proposals: the cover (Dated, Prepared For, Prepared By), the boxed sections Introduction, Scope Of Work, Professional Fees, Expenses, And Taxes, General And Specific Assumptions, Limitation Of Liability, Acknowledgement And Acceptance (headings in tables), the signature block, then Annexures A (scope), B (fees) and C (assumptions), and D (the team) in one of six; supplementary and fee-only proposals drop the scope and assumptions (decision proposal_form).",
  "completeLevels": [],
  "headingKinds": {
    "annexure_heading": 1,
    "annex_h1": 2
  },
